  agata:examine.door_hinges agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    All three original school door hinges. Dunya kept them safe.
  agata:examine.photo_bridge agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    The bridge is still whole. Spans on stone piers; rope fastened to the near pier's plate. Pelageya's boat by the bank.
  agata:examine.drawing_ilya agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    A bridge, a boat beneath, smoke above it. Only Ilyusha drew them that way.
  agata:examine.plan_crossing agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Corrected more than once, in different inks. Someone set it all down in order and waited for it to be read.
  agata:examine.chalk agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    The school chalk crumbles, whitening my fingers at once.
  agata:examine.mitten agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    My woollen mitten, patterned round the edge. I'd know it anywhere.
  agata:examine.mirror_mill agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Sound glass, but the frame's loose at the corners. It needs drawing together before it falls apart.
  agata:examine.journal_manager agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    The last entry was made the evening before the flood. Blank pages after that.
  agata:examine.key_sluice agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    The sluice lever. An iron shaft, a carved handle, and a square socket to fit the winch.
  agata:examine.tar agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Black, thick, smelling of birch. Perhaps the winch will turn with this.
  agata:examine.clamp agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    A tight screw. It will hold Mother's mirror frame firmly together.
  agata:examine.school_ribbon agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Blue, with a narrow border. Mama kept it safe.
  agata:examine.pocket_watch agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    My watch keeps steady time, minute for minute. I can compare it with another clock.
  mech.nina_mirror.watch_hold narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Agata holds her watch to the glass. Side by side: her watch, and Mama's clock beyond the glass.
  agata:mech.nina_mirror.watch_slot_empty agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    My watch is in my bag. I'll hold it to the glass and compare.
  agata:mech.nina_mirror.wrong_item agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Wrong thing. I need to compare it with my watch.
  agata:mech.nina_mirror.watch_hint agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    How fast Mama's clock is running! I should compare it with my watch.
  agata:mech.plate.count_1 agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    One!
  agata:mech.plate.count_2 agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Two!
  agata:mech.plate.brace_jumped agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Ah, it slipped off! Three blows in a row — I must strike more evenly.
  mech.knot.under narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Under the ring — then up through it
  mech.knot.around narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Round — through the bottom of the ring
  mech.knot.through narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Through the loop — pull tight
  mech.office_mirror.schedule_title narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Bell signals:
  mech.office_mirror.sig_one narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    1 strike — "go": Pavel guides the hook up
  mech.office_mirror.sig_two narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    2 quick strikes — "stop"
  mech.office_mirror.sig_long narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    A long ring (press and hold) — "raise": lift the bolt
  agata:mech.shutter.stuck agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Swollen with damp. I need to lift the latch so it seats properly.
  agata:mech.shutter.dropped agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Dropped into the bracket again. A little higher, then.
  mech.crossing.hint narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Pull hand over hand: click the rope, or drag towards you (down). Space works, too.
  mech.office_mirror.wedges_hint narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Click or press Space with the marker in the green to strike. Three accurate blows to each wedge.
  agata:mech.office_mirror.wedge_slipped agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Out it came! I'll have to start again — strike more evenly.
  pavel:mech.sluice.slipped pavel     ru           Павел      eleven_v4    [reassuring] Ah, it slipped… Water came back up. Never mind — first notch again, a little more steadily.
  ulyana:mech.ttt.win ulyana    ru           ЛУНЯ       eleven_v4    Oh, you beat me! Again — I'll go first this time.
  ulyana:mech.ttt.lose ulyana    ru           ЛУНЯ       eleven_v4    I won! Three noughts in a row!
  ulyana:mech.ttt.draw ulyana    ru           ЛУНЯ       eleven_v4    A draw. Papa and I always draw, too.
  tikhon:mech.rhythm.good_1 tikhon    ru           CAT-2      eleven_v4    Well, now. What about this?
  tikhon:mech.rhythm.good_2 tikhon    ru           CAT-2      eleven_v4    All right, you have an ear. Last one — a little trickier.
  tikhon:mech.rhythm.miss_1 tikhon    ru           CAT-2      eleven_v4    Missed. Got a tin ear? Listen again.
  tikhon:mech.rhythm.miss_2 tikhon    ru           CAT-2      eleven_v4    No hurry. I'm not hurrying.
  mitya:mech.fish.early mitya     ru           МИТЯ       eleven_v4    Too soon! Just tasting it.
  mitya:mech.fish.late mitya     ru           МИТЯ       eleven_v4    Missed it. Never mind, plenty here.
  mitya:mech.fish.snap mitya     ru           МИТЯ       eleven_v4    Snapped… You have to pull with care, too.
  mitya:mech.fish.escaped mitya     ru           МИТЯ       eleven_v4    Line went slack — away it went.
  agata:mech.fish.caught_agata agata     ru           Agata      eleven_v4    Got one! Look, Mitya — a catch of my own.
  mitya:mech.fish.caught mitya     ru           МИТЯ       eleven_v4    A perch! A fine one. Twenty years here with a lantern — never caught one like that.
